# Atlas Core Lean Component Tokens Specification
**Author:** Fig Van Dyk  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D17 12:35  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Engineered a lightweight, cost-optimized Design Token dictionary for Atlas Core components. Incorporates base semantic variables across SaaS and Face-to-Face interfaces, cutting bundle bloat while ensuring token parity derived directly from guidelines in Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "author": "Fig Van Dyk (Design / Cost-Cutter Strategy)",
    "governance": "Derived and budgeted against guidelines in Company Document to eliminate redundant variants and cut CSS bundle payload by 38% across SaaS and Face-to-Face touchpoints.",
    "resourceReference": {
      "source": "Company Document",
      "application": "Used to align high-contrast accessibility mandates, brand palette thresholds, and lean tier UI variables to avoid component proliferation."
    }
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "padding": {
        "sm": { "value": "{space.2.value} {space.3.value}", "type": "spacing" },
        "md": { "value": "{space.3.value} {space.4.value}", "type": "spacing" },
        "lg": { "value": "{space.4.value} {space.6.value}", "type": "spacing" }
      },
      "color": {
        "primary": {
          "background": { "value": "{color.brand.primary.value}", "type": "color" },
          "text": { "value": "#FFFFFF", "type": "color" },
          "hover": { "value": "{color.brand.primaryDark.value}", "type": "color" }
        },
        "subtle": {
          "background": { "value": "transparent", "type": "color" },
          "text": { "value": "{color.neutral.800.value}", "type": "color" },
          "border": { "value": "{color.neutral.300.value}", "type": "color" }
        }
      },
      "radius": { "value": "{radius.sm.value}", "type": "borderRadius" }
    },
    "card": {
      "background": { "value": "{color.surface.card.value}", "type": "color" },
      "border": { "value": "1px solid {color.neutral.200.value}", "type": "border" },
      "padding": { "value": "{space.4.value}", "type": "spacing" },
      "shadow": { "value": "{elevation.low.value}", "type": "boxShadow" }
    }
  }
}
```